//!    The path keeps that leading `/` and everything after it; with no `/` the
//!    path is empty.
//! 5. **Userinfo** — inside the authority only, drop everything up to and
//!    including the first `@`. First, not last: `a@b@c.com` -> host `b@c.com`.
